OL,3,AMajor US outlets boycott shared Trump
OL,4,Acoverage in protest at media ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor US television networks suspended
OL,7,Ftheir pooled coverage of President
OL,8,FDonald Trump on Monday in response to
OL,9,FCNN, Politico and MS NOW being barred
OL,10,Ffrom the White House.
OL,12,FTrump announced the ban on Friday as he
OL,13,Faccused the organisations of writing
OL,14,F"fiction or lies" about his
OL,15,Fadministration. The companies said
OL,16,Ftheir reporters were denied access to
OL,17,Fthe building on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
